SET
@unchecked
Generic fixed-state-machine operation id for setting a 16-bit slot to a constant.
===
ADD_CONST
@unchecked
Adds a constant to a 16-bit word slot and stores the wrapped 16-bit result.
===
COPY
@unchecked
Copies one 16-bit word slot to another.
===
AND_CONST
@unchecked
Bitwise-ANDs a 16-bit word slot with a constant and stores the 16-bit result.
===
OR_CONST
@unchecked
Bitwise-ORs a 16-bit word slot with a constant and stores the 16-bit result.
===
XOR_CONST
@unchecked
Bitwise-XORs a 16-bit word slot with a constant and stores the 16-bit result.
===
SHL_CONST
@unchecked
Logically shifts a 16-bit word slot left by a constant count and stores the wrapped 16-bit result.
===
SHR_CONST
@unchecked
Logically shifts a 16-bit word slot right by a constant count.
===
LOAD_WORD
@unchecked
Loads a 16-bit word from a bound word store using the admitted word-slot address form.
===
STORE_WORD
@unchecked
Stores a 16-bit word to a bound word store using the admitted word-slot address form.
===
ADDR18_FROM_WORD
@unchecked
Copies a 16-bit word slot into an 18-bit address scratch slot. Address scratch is separate from architectural word slots.
===
ADDR18_SHL
@unchecked
Shifts an 18-bit address scratch slot left by a constant count while remaining in the separate 18-bit address domain.
===
ADDR18_ADD_WORD
@unchecked
Adds a 16-bit word-slot value to an 18-bit address scratch slot and stores the result in the address domain.
===
LOAD_WORD_ADDR18
@unchecked
Loads a bound word store through an 18-bit byte address held in address scratch.
===
ADD_WORD
@unchecked
Adds two 16-bit word slots and stores the wrapped 16-bit result.
===
SUB_WORD
@unchecked
Subtracts two 16-bit word slots and stores the wrapped 16-bit result.
===
AND_WORD
@unchecked
Bitwise-ANDs two 16-bit word slots and stores the 16-bit result.
===
OR_WORD
@unchecked
Bitwise-ORs two 16-bit word slots and stores the 16-bit result.
===
XOR_WORD
@unchecked
Bitwise-XORs two 16-bit word slots and stores the 16-bit result.
===
ADD_CARRY_WORD
@unchecked
Computes the unsigned carry predicate for addition of two 16-bit word slots and stores the boolean result as an admitted word value.
===
SUB_BORROW_WORD
@unchecked
Computes the unsigned borrow predicate for subtraction of two 16-bit word slots and stores the boolean result as an admitted word value.
===
ADD_OVERFLOW_WORD
@unchecked
Computes the signed-overflow predicate for addition of two 16-bit word slots and stores the boolean result as an admitted word value.
===
SUB_OVERFLOW_WORD
@unchecked
Computes the signed-overflow predicate for subtraction of two 16-bit word slots and stores the boolean result as an admitted word value.
===
STAGE_WORD_ADDR18
@unchecked
Stages a 16-bit word write to a bound word store through an 18-bit byte address. The bound store is unchanged until the machine's staged writes are explicitly committed.
===
STAGE_BYTE_ADDR18
@unchecked
Stages the low byte of a 16-bit slot to a bound word store through an 18-bit byte address. Byte-lane selection comes from address bit zero; the bound store is unchanged until explicit commit.
===
LOAD_BYTE_ADDR18
@unchecked
Loads a zero-extended byte through an 18-bit byte address. Reads observe any earlier staged word or byte writes in the same machine before the bound store.
===
